<title>USA: Schering unit sues Amgen.</title>
<headline>Schering unit sues Amgen.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schering Corp, a unit of Schering-Plough Corp, on Wednesday said it has filed a patent infringement suit in U.S. District Court for the District of Delaware in Wilmington against Amgen Inc.</p>
<p>The suit charges that Amgen's manufacture and use of Schering's interferon product INFERGEN infringes U.S. Patent No. 4,530,901 held by Biogen Inc, the company said.</p>
</text>
